 docs/flows · 9 use cases in 3 activities

 1 Find products
   A shopper looks for something to buy.
   ├─ Browse the storefront
   ├─ Browse a collection
   ├─ Search for products
   └─ Read a store page

 2 Choose and buy
   A shopper picks a product and pays.
   ├─ View a product and choose options
   ├─ Add an item to the cart
   ├─ Manage the cart
   └─ Check out a cart

 3 Sync the store
   Shopify keeps the catalogue fresh.
   └─ Refresh the catalogue after a store edit
